# Ask — do not guess

If a fact is missing, stop and ask. Do not invent copy, layout, breakpoints, colors, type, spacing, page structure, or product decisions.

Ask when any of these are unknown:

- Which Figma frame or section to match
- Whether a tablet (or other) breakpoint exists in Figma
- Whether a menu page should be real or stay “coming soon”
- Hosting, domain, or CMS choices
- Content the Figma file does not contain

If two readings of Figma conflict, ask which one to follow. Do not pick.
